---
layout: base.njk
title: Transmissions
permalink: /blog/
---
<h1>Transmissions</h1>
<p>Received at irregular intervals. Signal strength varies.</p>

<p class="tag-filter">Frequencies:
{%- for t in collections.topics %} <a href="/blog/tags/{{ t | slugify }}/">#{{ t }}</a>{% endfor %}
</p>

<ul class="post-list">
{%- for post in collections.post | reverse %}
  <li><time>{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>{% if loop.first %} <span class="new-badge">NEW!</span>{% endif %}
    {% set tags = post.data.tags %}{% include "tag-list.njk" %}</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
